steps.message:
The reproduction now reaches the intended missing-route error. Draft cards cannot normally receive comments, so to test the historical/data-integrity edge case accurately I’ll create a comment while published and then force the card status to drafted; this verifies the search’s card-level publication filter protects both the card and its comments.

I’ll now implement:
- `GET /search` and a thin `SearchController`;
- a `Card::Searchable` concern with portable, escaped, case-insensitive matching via correlated `EXISTS`;
- a helper that converts rich text to plain text, escapes it, and highlights case-insensitive matches safely;
- a search form and result view with matching title/description/comment excerpts;
- a menu entry so the feature is discoverable.

